  "hindi": "हे राजन् यम, यह तुम्हारी कन्या वधू है; वह नीचे स्थापित की जाए। वह माता के घर में बाँधी जाए, और भाई के, और पिता के भी।",
  "english": "This maiden, this bride is yours, O King Yama; let her be set down. Let her be bound in the house of her mother, and also of her brother, and also of her father.",
